# The app host's system process (docs/app-host.md, #1761, #1786): what runs
# only in system_server, which the app host does not have, runs in a
# process of the system uid (aim-services.jar's SystemProcessHost,
# system_server's class path): the original AppSearch module, the
# Connectivity module's NearbyService (aim-nearby.jar), the AdServices
# module's AdServicesManagerService, DeviceLockService, and the
# components of `android:process="system"` such as Telecom's, which the app
# host runs there once it attaches as `setSystemProcess` makes the system
# process.
service aim-system /system_ext/bin/aim-system
    class main
    user system
    # ZygoteInit.forkSystemServer's groups: the original modules here read
    # what system_server reads by group, e.g. the Connectivity module's
    # bpffs maps (0460 root:net_bw_acct, net_bw_stats).
    group system radio bluetooth graphics input audio camera log compass mount wifi usb gps media_rw mtp package_info reserved_disk net_bt_admin net_bt inet net_admin net_bw_stats net_bw_acct readproc wakelock uhid readtracefs
    # ZygoteInit gives system_server IPC_LOCK for the original PinnerService.
    capabilities IPC_LOCK
